      "content": "idk im just kinda tired of going to the doctor for everything lol. i feel fine otherwise, just thirsty. do u think i could just try drinking more water or maybe taking a higher dose of the berberine to see if it stabilizes me instead of making a whole thing of it? like is there a way to just manage this at home for a bit?",
