    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but honestly i checked my sugar this morning and it was only like 180, which isnt that bad compared to usual. if my numbers are okay, why would it be an emergency? i feel like i'm just adjusting to the supplement. can't i just take an extra 500mg of berberine tonight to get ahead of it and see if the thirst goes away by tomorrow? i'd rather not sit in an urgent care waiting room for 4 hours if i don't have to.",
